{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>כי</b> — He speaks to Israel: as you drank the cup, so shall all the nations drink." "<b>ולעו</b> — like ילע קדש (Leviticus 10:17). The meaning: swallowing, except it is missing a bet [i.e., defective of ב]. Yefet said: as the nations drank and rejoiced upon My holy mountain, so shall they drink upon the mountain of Esau."], :book :obadiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Obadiah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=18&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:20:31.977360638Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}